[{"url": "https://www.biarrinetworks.com/customers", "title": "Customers | Biarri Networks", "content": "Customers. Our Customers. Network operators. EPC contractors. Engineering service providers. Learn more. Privacy Policy\n\u00a9 Copyright 2024 \nBiarri Networks. All Rights Reserved. "},{"url": "https://www.biarrinetworks.com/use-cases", "title": "Use Cases | Biarri Networks", "content": "Use Cases. Our Use Cases. Planning and Design. Automate network design, planning and feasibility analysis to reduce cost and time to cost. Automated Design Updates. Rapidly update designs in response to field changes\u2014or permitting kickbacks. Faster Permitting. Automate the generation of permit packages, reducing time to permit. Construction Project Management. Streamline construction project management with digital workflows. BEAD Compliance. Automate BEAD reporting and compliance workflows. See more\n\n\n\n\nBiarri Networks. "},{"url": "https://www.biarrinetworks.com/use-cases/planning-and-design", "title": "Planning and Design | Biarri Networks", "content": "Biarri Networks\n\nPlanning and Design\n\nPlanning and Design\n\nAutomate network design, planning and feasibility analysis to reduce cost and time to design.\n\nThe Challenge\n\nDesigning fiber networks is a complex and time-consuming process. It requires significant expertise and experience to design a network that meets the requirements of the network operator, is cost-effective, and can be built within the constraints of the physical environment.\n\nThe Solution\n\nBiarri IQP automates network design, planning and feasibility analysis. It uses a combination of algorithms and heuristics to generate network designs that meet the requirements of the network operator, are cost-effective, and can be built within the constraints of the physical environment.\n\nThe Benefits\n\nFaster design\nReduced cost\nImproved accuracy\n\nPrivacy Diet\n\u00a9 Copyright 2024 Biarri Networks. All Rights Reserved. "},{"url": "https://ww