 ICP includes a permit tracking module that allows project managers to track permit applications across jurisdictions. This includes managing contacts, submission dates, expiry dates, and notes.\n\nPermit Tracking\n\nThe permit tracking module in Biarri ICP allows project managers to:\n\n1. Track permit applications across jurisdictions\n2. Link permits to design segments and tasks\n3. Automate document generation for permit submissions\n4. Track permit status and approvals\n\nThis is part of the broader effort to streamline the permitting process and reduce delays in fiber construction projects.\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\u00a9 Copyright 2024 Biarri Networks. All Rights Reserved. "}]
